<title>INDIA: Indian Shipping -- Cochin cargoes - Feb 26.</title>
<headline>Indian Shipping -- Cochin cargoes - Feb 26.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the berthing schedule of major vessels loading and unloading at India's Cochin port on</p>
<p>February 26:</p>
<p> Commodity	    Tons	    Ship		    Berthing</p>
<p>		     (LDD/ULD)</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Wheat		25,210 (ULD)     Jag Vivek		18/02</p>
<p>Crude		38,000 (ULD)     R.N.Tagore	     25/02</p>
<p>Copper</p>
<p> Concentrate     15,000 (ULD)     Nidamas		  26/02</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>		  Note:</p>
<p>	    LDD - Loading</p>
<p>	    ULD - Unloading</p>
<p>(Source: J.M.Baxi &amp; Co, Cochin)</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
